  <running_head>Epist. 2. ad</running_head>
  <main_text>
    <l n="1" type="ornament" para="true">[decorative typographic ornament band]</l>
    <l n="2" type="heading" level="1" para="true">Celeberrimo Theologo</l>
    <l n="3" type="heading" level="1">D. Johanni Claudio, Pastori</l>
    <l n="4" type="heading" level="1">Ecclesiæ Parisiensis, S D.</l>
    <l n="5" para="true">
      <i>Subiit</i> me sæpè admiratio, Vir</l>
    <l n="6">Reverende, quod de septua-</l>
    <l n="7">ginta viris, quibus nostram</l>
    <l n="8">novam Rationem per Epistolas</l>
    <l n="9">præfixas nostro <i>Jugulo Causæ</i> dicavi,</l>
    <l n="10">&amp; de quingentis viris doctis, qui illam</l>
    <l n="11">Rationem ad examen suum revocave-</l>
    <l n="12">runt, solus extitisti (nisi clarissimus</l>
    <l n="13">vir Petrus du Bosc paria tecum faciat)</l>
    <l n="14">qui illam, aut non probaret, aut non</l>
    <l n="15">pronunciaret, post semel intellectam</l>
    <l n="16">&amp; arreptam à viris qui præsunt ordini,</l>
    <l n="17">tum sacro, tum civili, hasce, sed longè</l>
    <l n="18">magnas utilitates, inde in orbem Chri-</l>
    <l n="19">stianum redundaturas.</l>
    <l n="20" para="true">I. Primò per eam brevissimâ viâ</l>
    <l n="21">debellari Papam &amp; totum systema Ro-</l>
    <l n="22">manense;</l>
  </main_text>
  <notes />
</page>
